{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">This demo of <strong>Untitled Hand Game: Titled Edition</strong> features an endless mode of the first level from the full game - See how far you go!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hands on sticks...</strong> You're one of them.\u00a0<strong>Things to hand out...</strong> There's a lot of them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622770/extras/Hand_Want-Open.png?t=1746543399\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a short journey no hand on a stick has been on until now and never again. Rummage through things, avoid being slapped, and hand stuff out to other hands before they lose their patience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">RUMMAGE THROUGH STUFF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stick your hand in various piles to find what the greedy hands are wanting. You'll need to be quick or they'll become impatient and just leave without even waving goodbye.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622770/extras/short-bath.gif?t=1746543399\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEEP THE STUFF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put your hand in danger to keep your stuff from falling on the floor, being slapped, or stolen by aliens in tiny UFOs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622770/extras/short-ufo.gif?t=1746543399\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">HAND OUT THAT STUFF</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gently pass it. Drop it. Launch it. Do what you must to give your fellow hands their stuff.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622770/extras/short-crashing.gif?t=1746543399\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Made with love and tea.</i></p>","backgroun